  "scope": "The same actual short-absorption witnesses are reindexed by literal original-label groups. One quotient tree retains every surviving singleton adjacency to the original common forest; high/weak original bills, root metric/future allocations and every surviving old credit are reindexed exactly. The literal two-stage prior connector union is retained, lies in the unit tree and is internal to the next roots, providing a proved next-stage freshness interface. The wrapper consumes the previously constructed PaidShortPhaseOutput and its same original residual adjacency. Transporting whole long components, later heavy classification/payment, empty roots, numerical compatibility, global weighted hierarchy/lightness, runtime and whole-paper audit remain open."
